  <Client>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ac6f33e371697904aa409cc4b2ae4bfd, type: 2}
  <TextContent>k__BackingField: 'Dear,

    A new idea possesses me. Nuances and
    flashes of liveliness. Tints that will make anyone heart skip a beat, tints that
    will breathe life into this tortured heart of mine.

    I live for them, these
    colours that got me obsessed. The canvas beckons.

    May your genius reach
    me,'
  <LetterType>k__BackingField: 0
